1. DEFINITIONS

   "Rocky Reviews" means the copyright holder named above and its successors.

   "Subscription" means a current, paid Rocky Reviews Enterprise subscription
   agreement between you (or your organisation) and Rocky Reviews that covers
   the Enterprise Software you are using.

   "Development Use" means running the Enterprise Software only to develop,
   test, evaluate, debug or contribute changes to it, with no real users and
   no real organisational data, for no longer than is reasonably needed for
   that purpose.

   "Production Use" means any use that is not Development Use, including
   serving the Enterprise Software, or a product that includes it, to anyone
   other than the developer working on it, whether or not for payment.

